      "value": "Hi, I'm on Windows 10, because of the Extended Suppo. Well, ESU, Oh Extended Security Updates probably. What is VCC doing when you try running it on Windows 11? And did it break in the last month?\n\nI have a friend I help with avatar work and they've been on windows 11 the whole time, we just haven't done anything in unity in the last two months...\n\nOh, their comment on Windows 11 not being fully tested with the creator companion is from April 19th 2023 according to (git-blame) https://github.com/vrchat-community/creator-companion/blame/main/Docs/docs/guides/getting-started.md",
