  "details": "I want to use VRChat Creator Companion on Windows 11, but VCC's limited support only for Windows 10 only makes me use third-party software such as ALCOM on Windows 11 instead or run VCC on Windows 11 without official support from VRChat.\n\n> The only fully-supported platform at the moment is Windows 10.\n\n- https://github.com/vrchat-community/creator-companion/blob/e94fccbdb5529f9772c2cc7bd6fccb90d8115e25/Docs/docs/vpm/cli.md#mac-and-linux-support\n\n- https://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/vpm/cli/#mac-and-linux-support\n\n[Windows 10 support has ended on October 14, 2025](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/windows-10-support-has-ended-on-october-14-2025-2ca8b313-1946-43d3-b55c-2b95b107f281).\n\n> Please use https://github.com/vrchat-community/creator-companion/issues/new/choose instead!\n\nI can't do so right now, sorry! Feel free to forward this.",
